# 複製成 .env 再改（docker compose 與 npm start 都讀得到；.env 不會進 git）
# Copy to .env and edit (read by docker compose; for npm start, export them or use node --env-file=.env server.js)

# 預設管理員（帳號 admin）的初始密碼，公開部署一定要設
# Initial password of the default admin (username: admin). Always set it for a public deployment.
ADMIN_PASSWORD=

# ---- 資料庫 Database ----
# 不設＝SQLite（資料在 DATA_DIR/switch.db，不用另外裝東西）
# Unset = SQLite (stored in DATA_DIR/switch.db, nothing else to install)
#
# 設了就改用 Postgres（本機要先 npm install；Docker 映像已經裝好）
# Set it to use Postgres (run npm install first when running locally; the Docker image already includes the driver)
# DATABASE_URL=postgres://aigile:change-me@localhost:5432/aigile
#
# 選填：把表放在這個 schema（沒有會自動建）／Optional: put the tables in this schema (created if missing)
# DATABASE_SCHEMA=aigile
#
# 用 docker-compose.postgres.yml 連資料庫一起起來時，資料庫的密碼（沒設＝aigile）
# Database password when starting Postgres with docker-compose.postgres.yml (default: aigile)
# POSTGRES_PASSWORD=change-me

# ---- 雲端 AI Cloud AI ----
# 選填：加密 API 金鑰用的主密鑰（32 個以上隨機字元）。不設會自動產生，存在 DATA_DIR/docs/_secrets/（不在資料庫裡）；換掉後已存的金鑰要重貼
# Optional: master key used to encrypt API keys (32+ random characters). If unset, one is generated and stored in DATA_DIR/docs/_secrets/ (outside the database). Changing it means re-entering saved keys.
# AIGILE_MASTER_KEY=
